":["Драма","Комедия","Мелодрама"],"overview":"Катри собирается в отпуск с подружками, но жених неожиданно делает ей предложение. Женское счастье так близко! Но придя в гости к жениху, она обнаруживает там каких-то посторонних людей, а сам жених на её глазах увозит свою беременную любовницу в роддом, оставив в квартире сумку с кучей евро…","source":"tmdb","episodes":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"501495","ru":"Greenlight","en":"Greenlight","year":"2019","type":"Фильм","rating":5.6,"votes":11,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/l9UWaOaqve2sc6CL6c9j1BWMcOM.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/psqwdk40kgtEWTSr2lWMHllor4W.jpg","genres":["Триллер","Ужасы"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","episodes":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"244117","ru":"Emily & Tim","en":"Emily & Tim","year":"2015","type":"Фильм","rating":5.6,"votes":11,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/vnRbuZpESsiXY4cSpCNjZ9RrgjH.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cll6hdaB3jNkZXUxrtsSqW4eTVk.jpg","genres":["Драма"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","episodes":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"470893","ru":"Spare Room","en":"Spare Room","year":"2018","type":"Фильм","rating":5.6,"votes":11,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/admr7XAJroIEEkMGCPJsJq0uEIu.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pJKmssh1KulwycrHGqhz1yISTDv.jpg","genres":["Драма"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","episodes":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"456426","ru":"టచ్ చెసి చూడూ","en":"టచ్ చెసి చూడూ","year":"2018","type":"Фильм","rating":5.6,"votes":11,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/nbjRmZ8VqQJm1id2p5BCGcPOXdd.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fHv7fxj9TYVLKCzuuRFR3Sd90Tx.jpg","genres":["Боевик"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","episodes":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"337961","ru":"四非","en":"四非","year":"2015","type":"Фильм","rating":5.6,"votes":11,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342